 "name_en": "Scheduling Agreement for Subcontracting Procurement (2NX)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Scheduling Agreement for Subcontracting Procurement (2NX)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio77ae1d09610e40f8a7efc90aeec5a2c1\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio77ae1d09610e40f8a7efc90aeec5a2c1__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">The use of scheduling agreements can shorten processing times and reduce the amount of paperwork you are faced with. One delivery schedule can replace many discrete purchase orders or contract release orders.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">A purchase requisition of type RV-Outline Agreement Requisition can be created with subcontracting line items (Item Category – L Subcontracting) manually by a requestor. The purchase requisition can be converted into a scheduling agreement. The scheduling agreement is subject to approval based on predefined parameters before you generate delivery schedule or schedule lines (manually or via MRP run) and communicate them to the subcontractor. The outbound delivery is created, and the goods are picked and shipped to the subcontractor. With the supply of the finished material, the goods receipt is created. The invoicing process is then triggered.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio77ae1d09610e40f8a7efc90aeec5a2c1__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create scheduling agreement for subcontracting manually or convert from PR</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Generate delivery schedule manually or by MRP run</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Approve scheduling agreement</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Print scheduling agreement</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create outbound delivery and post goods issue</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Post goods receipt</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create supplier invoice</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio77ae1d09610e40f8a7efc90aeec5a2c1__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Reduce effort for discrete purchase order creation</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Increase the automation of delivery schedule generation and accuracy of planning with MRP run</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Enable suppliers to plan and allocate their resources more efficiently with long term planning</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>转包采购的计划协议 (2NX)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio77ae1d09610e40f8a7efc90aeec5a2c1\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio77ae1d09610e40f8a7efc90aeec5a2c1__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">使用计划协议可以缩短处理时间，并减少您面临的文书工作量。一个交货计划可以替换许多离散采购订单或合同审批订单。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">申请人可以通过转包行项目（项目类别 – L 转包）手动创建类型为 RV 框架协议申请的采购申请。采购申请可以转换为计划协议。在生成交货计划或计划行（手动或通过 MRP 运行）并将其传达给转包商之前，计划协议需要根据预定义参数进行审批。创建出库交货，拣配货物并装运至转包商。随着成品物料的供应，创建收货。然后触发开发票流程。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio77ae1d09610e40f8a7efc90aeec5a2c1__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">手动创建转包的计划协议或从 PR 转换</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">手动或通过 MRP 运行生成交货计划</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">审批计划协议</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">打印计划协议</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建出库交货并过账发货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">过账收货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建供应商发票</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio77ae1d09610e40f8a7efc90aeec5a2c1__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">减少离散采购订单创建的工作量</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过 MRP 运行提高交货计划生成的自动化和计划准确性</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">支持供应商利用长期计划，更高效地计划和分配资源</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
